DIAGNOSTIC ONLY (gpuvmDceDebug): log the flip-completion awaken contract at
the three points where it is decided/consumed, to confirm the hypothesis that
a pending DRM page-flip's awaken never arrives because a downstream gate
requires the ISO surface to be non-NULL:

  1. nvidia-drm-modeset.c: whether nvidia-drm expects a flip-done event for
     this plane at all (pending_events_plane_mask).
  2. nvkms-kapi.c: whether KAPI actually requested WRITE_AWAKEN for this
     kickoff (only set when the primary layer's surface is non-NULL).
  3. nvkms-evo3.c: what EvoFlipC3Common actually programmed into hardware
     (WRITE vs WRITE_AWAKEN), after 0011's ISO-surface gate.

